1703	1766	1659	1660	the crowd	98	“ Begorra ! on the spools . Alleys behint , though we helped her , we dud . An wid ye ! Let Deb alone ! It 's ondacent frettin ' a quite body . Be the powers , an we 'll have a night of it ! there 'll be lashin 's o ' drink,--the Vargent be blessed and praised for't ! ”
